% Solutions to the Chapter 1 exercises.
accumulate pond.

% ANCHOR: ex1
% Exercise 1.1: the duck's food, and what eats algae.
pred ex1.
ex1 :-
  std.findall (eats duck X) A, print A,
  std.findall (eats Y algae) B, print B.
% ANCHOR_END: ex1

% ANCHOR: ex2
% Exercise 1.2: one critter both swims and flies.
pred ex2.
ex2 :- std.findall (swims X, flies X) A, print A.
% ANCHOR_END: ex2

% ANCHOR: ex3
% Exercise 1.3: what eats something that eats algae?
% Five answers. The frog and the fish each appear twice,
% once through the fly and once through the snail.
pred ex3.
ex3 :- std.findall (eats X Y, eats Y algae) A, print A.
% ANCHOR_END: ex3

main :- ex1, ex2, ex3.
